      "updated": 1790185477476,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- It is understood that members of the group root are NOT\n  prvileged users unless they have user ID 0\n- if you're a member of the group root, \n        ==> it doesn't mean that you are the root user,\n        ==> it doesn't mean that you have root privileges.\n- Remember that the root user gets their privileges from \n  having user ID 0, not by being made a member of group 0\n  or the group root.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- It is understood that members of the group root are NOT\n  prvileged users unless they have user ID 0\n- if you're a member of the group root, \n        ==> it doesn't mean that you are the root user,\n        ==> it doesn't mean that you have root privileges.\n- Remember that the root user gets their privileges from \n  having user ID 0, not by being made a member of group 0\n  or the group root.",
