      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> We do have a Web frontend in front of those registries :\n   and \n        ° you could use this Web frontend : \n            - to search for those images, \n            - to search for those resources that you need, \n              that you need to make use of in your solutions\n\n    That Frontend is called :\n        ° catalog.redhat.com",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> We do have a Web frontend in front of those registries :\n   and \n        ° you could use this Web frontend : \n            - to search for those images, \n            - to search for those resources that you need, \n              that you need to make use of in your solutions\n\n    That Frontend is called :\n        ° catalog.redhat.com",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1790185477413,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
